# Build context excludes for the FRONTEND image (context = frontend/).
# Without this, `COPY apps ./apps` drags host node_modules (macOS-native
# binaries) into a linux/amd64 image and the build silently uses the wrong
# esbuild/rollup platform binary.
#
# NOTE: the context is frontend/, NOT the repo root (changed 2026-07-28 when the
# JS workspace moved under frontend/). The old file also listed backend/,
# .git, .github, .env* — those now sit ABOVE the context and are unreachable
# by definition, so entries for them would be dead weight.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.claude
.gemini

docs

*.md
.DS_Store
